  "description": "Flyway C DLX RED XPLR pulls decades of gravel experience into the best gravel bike we can make. Our Deluxe carbon layup shaves 150 grams of frame weight, and our Class 5 VRS™ design reduces road vibration for a light, smooth ride. Flyway’s geometry is designed to feel confident when you’re pushing race pace and comfortable when you’re just out roaming for the day. Frame and fork cargo mounts (including direct-mount frame bag mounts) keep your kit streamlined whether you’re running fast and light or loaded up. SRAM’s RED XPLR 13-speed drivetrain offers a wide gear range and precision electronic shifting for an efficient and refined ride.",
